(registered 2026-10-13, last updated 2026-10-13)

Scheme name: ord

Status: provisional

Applications/protocols that use this scheme name:
Client applications that resolve human-readable on-chain names to
blockchain-inscribed content ("1Sat ordinals" model on BSV), including
the ORDnet web3 browser, the ORD/plug wallet extension and mobile
wallets, and indexers/search services implementing ODNCA standards.
"ord" is a content locator: it dereferences a name (mutable reference,
per the adopted scheme specification ODNCA-STD-005) or a 64-hex txid
(immutable reference) to inscribed content. It does not initiate
payments or other actions; action-oriented companion schemes are
registered separately (see sns, opns, ordmail below).

